  synthesize the heart-shaped herb after  eric killmonger burned the entire supply  in black panther the book says that  shuri even considers stabilizing the  effects of her synthetic herb  by adding some vibranium into the mix  but  she notes that she can't do much until  she has studied a  sample of the original botanical so  shuri is trying to recreate the  heart-shaped herb  but she's also trying to add some  vibranium to it this would mean that  vibranium would be  in the blood of whoever would eat the  heart-shaped herb  now obviously this is experimental but  one can imagine how strong somebody  would be if they actually had vibranium  infused in their blood with the effects  of all the other abilities that the  heart-shaped herb  gives the black panther but the sheer  fact that marvel was already planning on  a way to bring back the heart-shaped  herb  means that at one point in time they  were planning on at least having  somebody  challenge black panther for the throne  now obviously with chadwick passing away  we aren't going to get that  but since shuri is the one that is  creating this new heart-shaped herb and  she is the sister  to t'challa and heir of the throne it  would make perfect sense that she would  be the one to take on the black panther  mantle next  especially if she is in fact the creator  of this new heart-shaped herb because  without that there is no black panther  at least not with all the abilities that  have been passed down from generations  to generations  this also seems the way that marvel  would go because they probably would not  like to replace chadwick boseman  at least at first and marvel studios has  already stated that that is not their  focus right now so in terms of actually  replacing chadwick boseman's black  panther  that probably won't happen for a while  but a new black panther who is his  sister in the movies and really a sister  in real life to him honors his memory  his legacy and fits in the mcu pretty  well especially if you consider the fact  that in the comics she has taken on the  mantle of black panther before  so the story arc in the mcu would work  out the respect to chadwick boseman  would be paid and according to the  wakanda files the story is already set  up in the mcu for sure to create this  new heart-shaped herb and become the  next black panther this doesn't mean  that we won't get another male black  panther down the road but it sure does  look like shuri is going to be  the next one so let me know what you  think about shuri being the one to take  on the black panther mantle  next let me know what you think in the  comments down below and don't forget to  like the video and subscribe so you can  stay up to date on all the latest things  happening in the mcu  for live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching woof
 

